===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{m|non|markaðr}}, {{m|non|marknaðr||market}}, from northern {{etyl|fro|is}} {{m|fro|markiet}}, from {{etyl|fro|is}} {{m|fro|marchié}}, from {{etyl|la|is}} {{m|la|mercātus||market}}. Cognate with {{cog|fo|marknaður}}, {{cog|da|marked}}, {{cog|nb|marked}}, {{cog|sv|marknad}}.

